> wrap Y W?
> wrap X (f a (g a))?
> wrap X (f a (g b))?
> wrap X (f X Y)?
> wrap X X?
> wrap X (f Y (g Y))?
> unwrap (f 1 (g 2)) A B?
> unwrap W A B?
> unwrap (f 1 2) A B?
> pair a b P?
> pair X Y P, X = 1?
> swap (p 1 2) Q?
> swap Q (p 1 2)?
> swapall [p 1 2, p a b, p (f x) [y]] Qs?
> once (swapall [p 1 2 | T] Qs)?
> same a a?
> same a b?
> same 1 1?
> same 'a' 'a'?
> same X a?
> same a X?
> same X Y?
> same X Y, X = 3?
> same (f a) (f a)?
> same (f X) (f a)?
> same X (f X)?
> same [1, 2] [1, 2]?
> same (p X 2) (p 1 Y)?
> same (p X X) (p a b)?
> same (p X (f a)) (p (f a) Y)?
> same (p X Y) (p Y (f X))?
> twice a L?
> twice X [1, 1]?
> twice X [1, 2]?
> twice X [A, B]?
> twice 2.5 L?
> kind red K?
> kind X cool?
> kind 'c' K?
> kind green K?
> area (sq 3) A?
> area (rect 2 5) A?
> area (tri 4 5) A?
> area (circle 2) A?
> area (sq x) A?
> area S 9?
